# Keel's website is static: publish only the files the page needs. Everything else stays out of the deploy:
# the local tracker (tracker/) must never run as a public web function, and pyproject.toml / requirements*
# would otherwise make Vercel treat the project as a Python app (PYTHON_ENTRYPOINT_NOT_FOUND).
/*
!index.html
!sw.js
!manifest.json
!icon.svg
!icon-maskable.svg
!vercel.json
